20
00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:08.910
<v Maya>The Nasdaq Composite was up 0.4 percent and the Dow was down 1.1 percent.

21
00:01:09.370 --> 00:01:13.660
<v Alex>And in big tech, Amazon had the best day, up 3.8 percent,

22
00:01:13.660 --> 00:01:18.050
<v Alex>while Nvidia was at the other end, down 2.9 percent.

23
00:01:18.050 --> 00:01:19.760
<v Alex>That's a snapshot, not advice.

24
00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:26.520
<v Alex>Musk just said firing Jensen Huang feels like kicking Michael Jordan off a winning

25
00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:28.560
<v Alex>team, according to TechCrunch.

26
00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:33.800
<v Maya>He signed a petition with 200,000 people to get Nvidia back.

27
00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:34.510
<v Alex>Seriously?

28
